  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact at Scale to design, lead and manage the research and evaluation of scale up and innovation violence prevention approaches</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme will reduce violence against women and girls in LMIC countries through innovative project delivery, taking successful interventions to scale, and using evidence to influence others to programme at scale.</narrative>
  </description>
